<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Feb 8.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Feb 8.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in the northern and central regions of European Russia may be closed on February 8 due to low clouds and heavy snowstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Friday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
